  "title": "Granite’s IVGID Pipeline Project Recognized for Excellence in Partnering and Collaboration",
  "summary": "The Incline Village General Improvement District (IVGID) Effluent Export Pipeline project, located in Washoe County, Nevada, has received a John L. Martin Partnering Project of the Year Award from the International Partnering Institute (IPI). The award recognizes project teams that demonstrate a strong commitment to collaboration, trust, and shared success.",
